    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>13级 杂兵 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 魔法兽（气系，土系）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +14</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 27，''强韧'' 24，''反射'' 26，''意志'' 24</span><span>''侦查'' +10</span></div>\n<div><span>''免疫'' 疾病，毒素</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 0，飞行 8（盘旋）</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}喷砂</div>\n<div class=description>灵气 1：在该灵气内的敌人的所有防御受到-2 减值。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}磨砂击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+16 vs. 强韧<br>命中：12 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">旋涡步✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>该晶片风暴旋涡漏斗云快步 4 格。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 11（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 22（+12）</span><span>''感知'' 19（+10）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 19（+10）</span><span>''智力'' 5（+3）</span><span>''魅力'' 6（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 荒神语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
